<title>BRAZIL: Copel to price 8-yr putable Eurobond Tues.</title>
<headline>Copel to price 8-yr putable Eurobond Tues.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Parana state power firm Copel on Tuesday will price a $150 million eight-year Eurobond with puts and calls at five years, lead manager Santander Investment said.</p>
<p>&quot;The bond will be priced and launched on Tuesday,&quot; a Santander official said.</p>
<p>He said price talk on the deal ranges from 280 to 304 basis points over U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>((-- John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414))</p>
